cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or cite this artifact, please cite it as below."
title: "Receiver-reliance baseline: conformance suite and reference implementation"
abstract: >-
  A deterministic, auditable comparator for the decision a receiving agent makes
  about records handed to it by another agent. Ships a frozen 28-operation
  decision engine, a supplemental 2-operation generation closing its reviewed
  capability gaps, both conformance fixture suites, reference implementations
  that reproduce them byte-for-byte, and an audited decision surface whose
  results are mechanically re-derivable from published bytes.
type: software
